(7357419, 1152037, 62249, '<td valign="top">There''s potential for an interesting shot here. Work on the composition to find something in the texture or the lines to help lead a viewer''s eye through the image. And focus needs to be sharper, too.</td>', 'There''s potential for an interesting shot here. Work on the composition to find something in the texture or the lines to help lead a viewer''s eye through the image. And focus needs to be sharper, too.', '2015-06-05 01:44:21.000000', NULL, 1),
