(7357424, 1152021, 62249, '<td valign="top">I like the creativity of showing the leaves through the fabric, and the lighting and shadows on the doll side of the frame are interesting. The large dark area in the lower left of the frame doesn''t quite work.</td>', 'I like the creativity of showing the leaves through the fabric, and the lighting and shadows on the doll side of the frame are interesting. The large dark area in the lower left of the frame doesn''t quite work.', '2015-06-05 01:50:49.000000', NULL, 1),
