(7361328, 1151614, 61552, '<td valign="top">Show me the N/A.  Maybe I''ll ignore it.  Maybe I won''t.<br/> <br/>Art is in the eye of the artist and I''m not the only one who had a different take on it.  I call that being original but the intent was to bring a laugh.<br/> <br/>If I like it, I publish it.<br/>If someone else likes it, that''s a plus.<br/> - Frank Zappa<br/> <br/>I''ve said this before.  I don''t always take these competitions seriously.</td>', 'Show me the N/A.  Maybe I''ll ignore it.  Maybe I won''t. Art is in the eye of the artist and I''m not the only one who had a different take on it.  I call that being original but the intent was to bring a laugh. If I like it, I publish it.If someone else likes it, that''s a plus. - Frank Zappa I''ve said this before.  I don''t always take these competitions seriously.', '2015-06-12 12:09:43.000000', NULL, 0),
